WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.880
At dawn, a landowner hires
workers for his vineyard.

2
00:00:03.930 --> 00:00:06.040
They agree a day's wage.

3
00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:09.330
He goes back for more
workers at nine, at noon,

4
00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:11.570
at three, and at five.

5
00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:15.400
At evening, everyone gets
exactly the same coin.

6
00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:17.700
The all-day workers grumble.

7
00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:22.950
So why would a fair boss pay the one-hour
worker the same as the all-day worker?

8
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.450
Jesus told this story to
picture the Kingdom of Heaven.

9
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:30.360
In this mission, you'll explore
5 of his Kingdom parables.

10
00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:34.830
Then you'll weigh up whether these stories
are more about judgement or about God's

11
00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:36.030
love.

12
00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:40.840
Your mission: find out why a fair boss
would pay the one-hour worker the same

13
00:00:40.890 --> 00:00:42.270
as the all-day worker.
